{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40519,"sections":[{"id":"script-20519","name":"原始脚本 20519","scripts":[20519],"start":0,"count":43}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:1","scriptId":20519,"text":"波西娅的研究室中，正在进行一场试验。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:2","scriptId":20519,"text":"“这里的细胞裂变速度有些快，能不能帮忙处理一下？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:3","scriptId":20519,"text":"“如果想让细胞更快地和金属融合的话，推荐不要用你手里的溶剂，我之前解析过那东西。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:4","scriptId":20519,"text":"兰布达从试管架上取下另一瓶半透明的黑色溶剂递给了波西娅。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:5","scriptId":20519,"text":"“加速细胞的生长也意味着加速死亡，只想着控制细胞裂变速度是错误的想法，你拿这个试试吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:6","scriptId":20519,"text":"“哦哦～我这就试试～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:7","scriptId":20519,"text":"接过试剂后，波西娅看都没看就把半管溶液倒入了观察皿中。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:8","scriptId":20519,"text":"“裂变速度没减慢啊……反而有点加快了？等等，衰减速度竟然减慢了！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:9","scriptId":20519,"text":"“哼，提高细胞个体的强度才是根本，你们人类老是沿着固有思路进行反复研究和试验，浪费掉了太多时间。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:10","scriptId":20519,"text":"“真是太感谢了～我这里弄完就开始研究你的溶剂～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:11","scriptId":20519,"text":"波西娅从背后一把抱住了兰布达……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:12","scriptId":20519,"text":"“！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:13","scriptId":20519,"text":"面对这突如其来的拥抱，兰布达一个反射性的肘击，迅速挣脱了出来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:14","scriptId":20519,"text":"“你想干什么。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:15","scriptId":20519,"text":"“疼疼疼……就是想表达一下感谢之情嘛～兰布达，你这样是会交不到朋友的啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:16","scriptId":20519,"text":"波西娅捂着自己的肚子退了两步，看上去并没什么大碍。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:17","scriptId":20519,"text":"“…………”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:18","scriptId":20519,"text":"“又不是让你无偿提供技术和知识，所以我觉得感谢你是理所当然的事情。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:19","scriptId":20519,"text":"“但请不要从背后这样抱住我，刚才只是条件反射，如果骸虫也跟着发动攻击的话，那我可就要对不起了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:20","scriptId":20519,"text":"兰布达身上的骸虫如果在这里发动攻击，那整个实验室肯定会毁于一旦。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:21","scriptId":20519,"text":"“真危险……条件反射啊……旅行者难道都这样的？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:22","scriptId":20519,"text":"“……可能并不是。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:23","scriptId":20519,"text":"兰布达回想起自己的上司阿尔库涅在和尤拉嬉闹时候的情景，摇了摇头。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:24","scriptId":20519,"text":"“我想我需要习惯一下怎么和人类相处。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:25","scriptId":20519,"text":"“吼吼～这是吹得哪阵风啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:26","scriptId":20519,"text":"无视波西娅的玩笑，兰布达把挂在衣架上的斗篷批在了身上，这套特制斗篷可以让兰布达看起来不是那么的显眼。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:27","scriptId":20519,"text":"“是时候出去学习一下了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:28","scriptId":20519,"text":"“什么意思？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:29","scriptId":20519,"text":"波西娅托着自己的腮帮把脑袋歪向一边。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:30","scriptId":20519,"text":"“找支队伍参加并进一步观察，如果可以的话。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:31","scriptId":20519,"text":"“咦！？你这意思是要外出活动？这个……好像要得到团长的批准啊，你的存在是死水的重大机密啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:32","scriptId":20519,"text":"“只要拜托那支队伍的话，我想还是能做到隐蔽行动的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:33","scriptId":20519,"text":"“啊！……难道是他的队伍？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:34","scriptId":20519,"text":"“恩，知道我在死水又清楚我跟死水关系的队伍也屈指可数了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:35","scriptId":20519,"text":"“呜………………”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:36","scriptId":20519,"text":"话说到这里，波西娅陷入了沉思。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:37","scriptId":20519,"text":"“只是临时加入，很快就会回来的。既然已经承诺过协助你们我就一定会信守约定的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:38","scriptId":20519,"text":"“好吧～我会想办法搞定团长那里的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:39","scriptId":20519,"text":"“逃跑我倒是不担心啦，但可千万别被那位指挥官给拐跑了呀～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:40","scriptId":20519,"text":"“…………”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:41","scriptId":20519,"text":"“这个玩笑并不怎么好笑。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:42","scriptId":20519,"text":"兰布达轻描淡写地回了一句就径直离开了实验室，只留波西娅在那里愣了半晌。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20519:20519:43","scriptId":20519,"text":"“兰布达竟然会认真回答我的玩笑了！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
